@zentrale_moderate
title: Take <span class="m-radek rf-person">Radek</span>'s list, with Ewert, Lindau and Pfeiffer on it.
subtitle: Three men from the Left whom the majority can live with, and whom the Left does not count as its own. [+ mo_st_zentrale_moderate +]
choose-if: mo_ok_zentrale_moderate = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [+ mo_why_zentrale_moderate +]
